        "Ramadan complicates the planning in a way few other Gulf-adjacent calendars have to account for: school days shorten, evening routines shift later at home, and whichever week of the DP2 timetable Ramadan happens to fall on that year needs building into the essay and IA schedule well in advance rather than treated as a disruption discovered too late. Most schools still expect a complete extended-essay draft well before the final exam term begins, Ramadan or not.",
